Backport of upstream SDL's tray icon click callbacks, from SDL main:
  70e16a8d1 tray: Add icon click callbacks for Windows and macOS (#14964)
  cb0c7b01e tray: removed double click handling
Cherry-picked onto release-3.4.18; the dynapi tables keep only
SDL_CreateTrayWithProperties, and test/ is left out.

Upstream marks the API "available since SDL 3.6.0". As soon as a release
contains these commits, update SDL to that release and delete this patch.

